 r←Test_OptionsTool_001(stopFlag batchFlag);⎕TRAP;parms
⍝ Exercise "OptionsTools" with just the default.
⍝ Exception: when "autoPress" is not ¯1.
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.OptionsTool.CreateParms
 parms.timeout←0.1
 →T.FailsIf(1(6↑1))≢parms #.APLGUI.APLGUI.OptionsTool.Run⍕¨1000000+⍳6

 r←T._OK
